SeqEvi dbCAN runtime image
==========================

This image combines SeqEvi 0.2.0 (MIT), dbCAN 5.2.9 (GPL-3.0), DIAMOND
2.1.15 (GPL-3.0), CPython 3.13.11 and the hash-locked Python dependencies
recorded in requirements-seqevi.lock and requirements-dbcan.lock.

The complete license texts shipped by installed Python distributions are under
/usr/share/seqevi/licenses/python. The SeqEvi, dbCAN and DIAMOND license texts
are under /usr/share/seqevi/licenses. Component versions and upstream source
locations are recorded in /usr/share/seqevi/compliance.

The image does not contain a dbCAN annotation database. The files CAZy.dmnd,
dbCAN.hmm, dbCAN-sub.hmm and fam-substrate-mapping.tsv must be supplied and
mounted read-only by the caller.
